--- OLD
      JSR PtyGen_Frame              ; Do a frame and update joypad input
      LDA joy_a
      BNE DoNameInput               ; if A was pressed, do name input
--- NEW
      JSR PtyGen_Frame              ; Do a frame and update joypad input
      JSR PtyGen_A                  ; A: name input -- or, for a None, done
      NOP
